---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Kaipê Editora - Publicações Independentes" description="Quadrinhos, livros digitais e publicações culturais do Coletivo K.P.">
  <section class="relative min-h-[60vh] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden pt-24 pb-16 px-6" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FDF6E3 0%, #FAF3E0 100%); border-bottom: 2px solid #2C1F15;">
    <div class="orb orb-1"></div>
    <div class="orb orb-2"></div>
    <div class="container mx-auto text-center max-w-4xl relative z-10">
      <span class="text-xs font-mono font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest" style="color: #5C6B4F;">Editora</span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-black mt-3 tracking-tight" style="color: #2C1F15;">Kaipê <span class="gradient-text">Editora</span></h1>
      <p class="text-lg mt-6 max-w-2xl mx-auto" style="color: #4A3728; opacity: 0.8;">Publicações independentes que misturam arte, literatura e cultura digital.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="py-20 px-6" style="background: #FAF3E0;">
    <div class="container mx-auto max-w-6xl">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        <div>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest" style="color: #5C6B4F;">Nossa História</span>
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black mt-3" style="color: #2C1F15;">Publicações Independentes</h2>
          <p class="text-lg mt-6 leading-relaxed" style="color: #4A3728; opacity: 0.8;">A Kaipê Editora nasceu da necessidade de dar voz às produções culturais do Coletivo K.P. de Artistas Digitais. Desde 2018, publicamos tirinhas, livros e quadrinhos.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-3xl p-8" style="background: #FDF6E3; border: 2px solid #2C1F15; box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 #2C1F15;">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-6">
            <div class="text-center"><p class="text-4xl font-black gradient-text">6+</p><p class="text-sm mt-1" style="color: #4A3728; opacity: 0.6;">Publicações</p></div>
            <div class="text-center"><p class="text-4xl font-black gradient-text">100+</p><p class="text-sm mt-1" style="color: #4A3728; opacity: 0.6;">Páginas</p></div>
            <div class="text-center"><p class="text-4xl font-black gradient-text">2018</p><p class="text-sm mt-1" style="color: #4A3728; opacity: 0.6;">Início</p></div>
            <div class="text-center"><p class="text-4xl font-black gradient-text">Digital</p><p class="text-sm mt-1" style="color: #4A3728; opacity: 0.6;">Formato</p></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="py-20 px-6" style="background: #FAF3E0;">
    <div class="container mx-auto max-w-6xl">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest" style="color: #5C6B4F;">Catálogo</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black mt-3" style="color: #2C1F15;">Nossas Publicações</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="card-hover rounded-3xl overflow-hidden" style="background: #FDF6E3; border: 2px solid #2C1F15; box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 #2C1F15;">
          <div class="h-48 flex items-center justify-center text-7xl" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C75B39, #E07B5B);">🐛</div>
          <div class="p-6"><span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider" style="color: #4A3728; opacity: 0.6;">2018-2020 • Quadrinhos</span><h3 class="text-xl font-black mt-2" style="color: #2C1F15;">Vermes Realistas</h3><p class="text-sm mt-2" style="color: #4A3728; opacity: 0.8;">Webtirinhas humorísticas sobre filosofia e ciência.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="card-hover rounded-3xl overflow-hidden" style="background: #FDF6E3; border: 2px solid #2C1F15; box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 #2C1F15;">
          <div class="h-48 flex items-center justify-center text-7xl" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #5C6B4F, #7A8B6A);">📖</div>
          <div class="p-6"><span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider" style="color: #4A3728; opacity: 0.6;">2024 • Livro Digital</span><h3 class="text-xl font-black mt-2" style="color: #2C1F15;">Guia Mínimo dos Vermes</h3><p class="text-sm mt-2" style="color: #4A3728; opacity: 0.8;">Compilação completa das aventuras dos Vermes Realistas.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="card-hover rounded-3xl overflow-hidden" style="background: #FDF6E3; border: 2px solid #2C1F15; box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 #2C1F15;">
          <div class="h-48 flex items-center justify-center text-7xl" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #D4A843, #E8C97A);">🎨</div>
          <div class="p-6"><span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider" style="color: #4A3728; opacity: 0.6;">2023 • Arte</span><h3 class="text-xl font-black mt-2" style="color: #2C1F15;">Arte Digital Coletiva</h3><p class="text-sm mt-2" style="color: #4A3728; opacity: 0.8;">Mostra das produções artísticas do Coletivo K.P.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
